    "detailed_description": "In the desolate aftermath of a pitched battle between the nature-loving Bloodwarders and the Industrial Terrans, you step into the worn boots of a Panther Commando, Edward\u2014a last-ditch operative sent to complete the unthinkable. Your mission: infiltrate the heart of a damaged planet cracker, a colossal machine once used to tear celestial bodies apart for their resources, now left derelict to float over the vast expanse of space.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Dash across chasms, swing across damaged conduits, and scale the remnants of the planet cracker, a maze of twisted corridors, rusted catwalks, and malfunctioning machinery.<br></li><li> Fight with brutal hand-to-hand attacks and deliver combos beat-em-up style! Your enemies won't know what him them.<br></li><li> Explore a broken world, fight dangerous wildlife and synthetic contraptions. All of them out to kill you!</li></ul>",
